#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create, update, and use instances to run jobs with free or paid plans."
msgstr "Cipta, kemaskini, dan gunakan instans untuk menjalankan kerja dengan pelan percuma atau berbayar."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create and manage instances"
msgstr "Cipta dan urus instans"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create and manage instances {#create-and-manage-instances}"
msgstr "Cipta dan urus instans {#create-and-manage-instances}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Access to IBM Quantum Platform services is controlled by the **instances** to which you are assigned. Users can belong to multiple instances.\n"
msgstr "Akses kepada perkhidmatan IBM Quantum Platform dikawal oleh **instans** yang anda ditetapkan kepadanya. Pengguna boleh menjadi ahli beberapa instans.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Instances are virtual servers (deployments of Qiskit Runtime) that manage the execution of your workloads, including executing quantum programs and classical compute tasks (such as processing error mitigation).  Instances are identified by their *Cloud Resource Name* (CRN). This CRN can be used when sending workloads from your Qiskit programs.\n"
msgid "Instances are virtual servers (deployments of IBM Quantum Compute Service) that manage the execution of your workloads, including executing quantum programs and classical compute tasks (such as processing error mitigation).  Instances are identified by their *Cloud Resource Name* (CRN). This CRN can be used when sending workloads from your Qiskit programs.\n"
msgstr "Instans ialah pelayan maya (penempatan Qiskit Runtime) yang menguruskan pelaksanaan beban kerja anda, termasuk melaksanakan program kuantum dan tugas pengkomputeran klasik (seperti memproses mitigasi ralat). Instans dikenal pasti oleh *Cloud Resource Name* (CRN) mereka. CRN ini boleh digunakan semasa menghantar beban kerja dari program Qiskit anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can see the instances you have access to on the dashboard, or by clicking the \"Instances\" tab from the dashboard. Each instance is listed with its CRN identifier.\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh melihat instans yang anda ada akses di papan pemuka, atau dengan mengklik tab \"Instances\" dari papan pemuka. Setiap instans disenaraikan dengan pengecam CRN-nya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You need a different instance for every service plan (such as Open or Pay-As-You-Go) you use in every region that you want to use. The account manager and anyone with enough permission can create an instance and define its configuration, such as its allocations, usage limits, quantum computers, and user permissions.\n"
msgstr "Anda memerlukan instans yang berbeza untuk setiap pelan perkhidmatan (seperti Open atau Pay-As-You-Go) yang anda gunakan di setiap rantau yang ingin anda gunakan. Pengurus akaun dan sesiapa yang mempunyai kebenaran yang mencukupi boleh mencipta instans dan menentukan konfigurasinya, seperti peruntukan, had penggunaan, komputer kuantum, dan kebenaran pengguna.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The IBM Quantum Platform [dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) displays the instances to which you have access. Depending on your access, you can view full details, edit, and delete instances on the [Instances page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances).\n"
msgstr "[Papan pemuka](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) IBM Quantum Platform memaparkan instans yang anda ada akses. Bergantung pada akses anda, anda boleh melihat butiran penuh, mengedit, dan memadam instans di [halaman Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "It is important that you understand which instance you are using, because all instances that are not associated with the Open Plan incur a cost (or count toward your plan's alloted time).\n"
msgstr "Adalah penting anda faham instans mana yang anda gunakan, kerana semua instans yang tidak berkaitan dengan Open Plan menanggung kos (atau dikira ke arah masa yang diperuntukkan untuk pelan anda).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The jobs you run and the jobs run by other collaborators in the same instance count toward the reported usage for that instance. \n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Kerja yang anda jalankan dan kerja yang dijalankan oleh rakan kolaborator lain dalam instans yang sama dikira ke arah penggunaan yang dilaporkan untuk instans tersebut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can view an instance's usage on the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page, or, for those with the proper authority, the [Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics) page.  Note that the pages might show different usage numbers because the Instance page shows total usage prior to the current timestamp, while the Analytics page uses full-day boundaries.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh melihat penggunaan instans di halaman [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances), atau, bagi mereka yang mempunyai autoriti yang sesuai, di halaman [Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics). Perhatikan bahawa halaman-halaman tersebut mungkin menunjukkan nombor penggunaan yang berbeza kerana halaman Instance menunjukkan jumlah penggunaan sebelum cap masa semasa, manakala halaman Analytics menggunakan sempadan hari penuh.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"open-plan\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"open-plan\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open Plan instance {#open-plan-instance}"
msgstr "Instans Open Plan {#open-plan-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Open Plan users can run quantum circuits on the world's best QPUs for free (up to 10 minutes per 28-day rolling window). The QPU usage can be tracked on the [Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) and the [Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads) pages.\n"
msgstr "Pengguna Open Plan boleh menjalankan litar kuantum pada QPU terbaik di dunia secara percuma (sehingga 10 minit setiap tetingkap bergulir 28 hari). Penggunaan QPU boleh dipantau di halaman [Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) dan [Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"standard-plan\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"standard-plan\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pay-As-You-Go Plan instance {#pay-as-you-go-plan-instance}"
msgstr "Instans Pay-As-You-Go Plan {#pay-as-you-go-plan-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Pay-As-You-Go Plan is a paid plan. To use this plan, you must create an instance and assign it to the plan. All workloads sent to QPUs by using this plan incur a charge. Pay-as-you-go instances can have a total cost limit (optional).\n"
msgstr "Pay-As-You-Go Plan ialah pelan berbayar. Untuk menggunakan pelan ini, anda mesti mencipta instans dan menetapkannya kepada pelan tersebut. Semua beban kerja yang dihantar ke QPU menggunakan pelan ini menanggung caj. Instans Pay-as-you-go boleh mempunyai had jumlah kos (pilihan).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"flex-plan\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"flex-plan\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Flex Plan instance {#flex-plan-instance}"
msgstr "Instans Flex Plan {#flex-plan-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Flex Plan is a paid plan. To use this plan, you must first [Contact IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) to sign up. Then, create an instance and assign it to the plan. All workloads sent to QPUs by using this plan count toward your alloted subscription. \n"
msgstr "Flex Plan ialah pelan berbayar. Untuk menggunakan pelan ini, anda mesti terlebih dahulu [Hubungi IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) untuk mendaftar. Kemudian, cipta instans dan tetapkannya kepada pelan tersebut. Semua beban kerja yang dihantar ke QPU menggunakan pelan ini dikira ke arah langganan yang diperuntukkan untuk anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "An administrator can set a usage limit on a Flex Plan instance that applies for the duration of the contract. If an instance has been marked as \"limited\" by your administrator (you will see a \"Remaining\" column in the usage area) and the instance exceeds its allocation (defined by your administrator), any active workload will continue running (including sessions) but pending workloads will remain in the queue until more time is available. If an instance is not limited and the instance exceeds its allocation, jobs run with that instance are likely to run at a lower priority and experience longer queue times.\n"
msgstr "Pentadbir boleh menetapkan had penggunaan pada instans Flex Plan yang terpakai untuk sepanjang tempoh kontrak. Jika instans telah ditandakan sebagai \"terhad\" oleh pentadbir anda (anda akan melihat lajur \"Remaining\" dalam kawasan penggunaan) dan instans melebihi peruntukkannya (ditakrifkan oleh pentadbir anda), sebarang beban kerja yang aktif akan terus berjalan (termasuk Session) tetapi beban kerja yang belum dilaksanakan akan kekal dalam giliran sehingga lebih banyak masa tersedia. Jika instans tidak terhad dan instans melebihi peruntukkannya, kerja yang dijalankan dengan instans tersebut berkemungkinan berjalan dengan keutamaan lebih rendah dan mengalami masa giliran yang lebih lama.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "An alert displays on an instance's usage when it has exceeded its allocation.\n"
msgstr "Amaran dipaparkan pada penggunaan instans apabila ia melebihi peruntukkannya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"premium-plan\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"premium-plan\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Premium Plan instance {#premium-plan-instance}"
msgstr "Instans Premium Plan {#premium-plan-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Premium Plan is a paid plan. To use this plan, you must first [Contact IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) to sign up. Then, create an instance and assign it to the plan. All workloads sent to QPUs by using this plan count toward your alloted subscription. \n"
msgstr "Premium Plan ialah pelan berbayar. Untuk menggunakan pelan ini, anda mesti terlebih dahulu [Hubungi IBM](https://www.ibm.com/account/reg/us-en/signup?formid=MAIL-quantum) untuk mendaftar. Kemudian, cipta instans dan tetapkannya kepada pelan tersebut. Semua beban kerja yang dihantar ke QPU menggunakan pelan ini dikira ke arah langganan yang diperuntukkan untuk anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "An administrator can set a usage limit on a Premium Plan instance that applies for the plan's 28-day rolling usage window.  If an instance has been marked as \"limited\" by your administrator (you will see a \"Remaining\" column in the usage area) and the instance exceeds its allocation (defined by your administrator), any active workload will continue running (including sessions) but pending workloads will remain in the queue until more time is available. If an instance is not limited and the instance exceeds its allocation, jobs run with that instance are likely to run at a lower priority and experience longer queue times.\n"
msgstr "Pentadbir boleh menetapkan had penggunaan pada instans Premium Plan yang terpakai untuk tetingkap penggunaan bergulir 28 hari pelan tersebut. Jika instans telah ditandakan sebagai \"terhad\" oleh pentadbir anda (anda akan melihat lajur \"Remaining\" dalam kawasan penggunaan) dan instans melebihi peruntukkannya (ditakrifkan oleh pentadbir anda), sebarang beban kerja yang aktif akan terus berjalan (termasuk Session) tetapi beban kerja yang belum dilaksanakan akan kekal dalam giliran sehingga lebih banyak masa tersedia. Jika instans tidak terhad dan instans melebihi peruntukkannya, kerja yang dijalankan dengan instans tersebut berkemungkinan berjalan dengan keutamaan lebih rendah dan mengalami masa giliran yang lebih lama.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"connect-instance\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"connect-instance\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specify an instance in your code {#specify-an-instance-in-your-code}"
msgstr "Tentukan instans dalam kod anda {#specify-an-instance-in-your-code}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use the CRN or instance name to specify an instance to use - either when initializing the service, or when sending the workload to a QPU (for example, with [`QiskitRuntimeService.backend()](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backend)). For instructions to specify an instance in your code, see [Initialize your account](/guides/initialize-account).\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh menggunakan CRN atau nama instans untuk menentukan instans yang hendak digunakan — sama ada semasa memulakan perkhidmatan, atau semasa menghantar beban kerja ke QPU (contohnya, dengan [`QiskitRuntimeService.backend()](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backend)). Untuk arahan menentukan instans dalam kod anda, lihat [Mulakan akaun anda](/guides/initialize-account).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "When an instance is passed in, only backends and jobs from that instance are available (allowed in Qiskit Runtime v0.40.1 and later).\n"
msgid "When an instance is passed in, only backends and jobs from that instance are available (allowed in `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.40.1 and later).\n"
msgstr "Apabila instans dihantar masuk, hanya Backend dan kerja dari instans tersebut yang tersedia (dibenarkan dalam Qiskit Runtime v0.40.1 dan ke atas).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If an instance is not included when initializing the service, all backends and jobs across all instances in your account are available. In this case, when a backend is specified, an instance that can access the backend is found and used as described in [Automatically select the instance](/guides/initialize-account#auto-select).\n"
msgstr "Jika instans tidak disertakan semasa memulakan perkhidmatan, semua Backend dan kerja dari semua instans dalam akaun anda tersedia. Dalam kes ini, apabila Backend ditentukan, instans yang boleh mengakses Backend dijumpai dan digunakan seperti yang diterangkan dalam [Pilih instans secara automatik](/guides/initialize-account#auto-select).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"important\" title=\"Required versions\">\n"
"Qiskit Runtime v0.40.1 or later is required for the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"important\" title=\"Versi yang diperlukan\">\n"
"Qiskit Runtime v0.40.1 atau lebih baru diperlukan untuk yang berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using the instance name to specify an instance\n"
msgstr "Menggunakan nama instans untuk menentukan instans\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Not passing in an instance\n"
msgstr "Tidak menghantar instans\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setting a preferred instance type and region\n"
msgstr "Menetapkan jenis instans dan rantau pilihan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For Qiskit Runtime v0.42 or later, free plans are prioritized by default when [automatic instance selection](/guides/initialize-account#auto-select) is used.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk Qiskit Runtime v0.42 atau lebih baru, pelan percuma diutamakan secara lalai apabila [pemilihan instans automatik](/guides/initialize-account#auto-select) digunakan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"add-instance\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"add-instance\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an instance {#create-an-instance}"
msgstr "Cipta instans {#create-an-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Follow these steps to create an instance and add it to your account. If you are an administrator who needs to set up Qiskit Runtime on Cloud for your organization, refer to [Plan Qiskit Runtime for an organization](/guides/considerations-set-up-runtime).\n"
msgid "Follow these steps to create an instance and add it to your account. If you are an administrator who needs to set up Quantum Compute on Cloud for your organization, refer to [Plan Quantum Compute for an organization](/guides/considerations-set-up-runtime).\n"
msgstr "Ikut langkah-langkah ini untuk mencipta instans dan menambahkannya ke akaun anda. Jika anda pentadbir yang perlu menyediakan Qiskit Runtime on Cloud untuk organisasi anda, rujuk [Rancang Qiskit Runtime untuk organisasi](/guides/considerations-set-up-runtime).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"switcher\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"switcher\"></span>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "To add an instance to your account, first ensure you have the correct account and region selected in the account switcher in the header.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menambah instans ke akaun anda, pastikan dahulu anda telah memilih akaun dan rantau yang betul dalam penukar akaun di pengepala.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '        * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can have (or be part of) multiple IBM Cloud accounts.  If you don't see the instances or jobs you're expecting, try a different account.\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh mempunyai (atau menjadi sebahagian daripada) beberapa akaun IBM Cloud. Jika anda tidak nampak instans atau kerja yang dijangkakan, cuba akaun yang berbeza.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '        * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can access either region by using the same API key, but you can only see and access the instances that were created in the region that you're logged in to.\n"
msgstr "Anda boleh mengakses mana-mana rantau menggunakan kunci API yang sama, tetapi anda hanya boleh melihat dan mengakses instans yang dicipta dalam rantau yang anda log masuk.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '        * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you want to create an Open instance, you must choose the us-east region.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda ingin mencipta instans Open, anda mesti memilih rantau us-east.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        ![The IBM Quantum Platform header is shown.  The account switcher is immediately to the right of the search bar.  The region switcher is immediately to the right of the account switcher.](/docs/images/guides/cloud-setup/IQP-Header.avif 'IBM Quantum Platform header')\n"
msgstr "        ![The IBM Quantum Platform header is shown.  The account switcher is immediately to the right of the search bar.  The region switcher is immediately to the right of the account switcher.](/docs/images/guides/cloud-setup/IQP-Header.avif 'IBM Quantum Platform header')\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   <span id=\"regions\"></span>\n"
msgstr "   <span id=\"regions\"></span>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   <Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"About regions\">\n"
"   The instance will be created in the selected region. This region determines these important characteristics:\n"
"     * Which QPUs are available.\n"
"     * Where the jobs' classical computation, such as compilation, takes place.\n"
"     * Where the user's workflow data remains.\n"
msgstr ""
"   <Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Tentang rantau\">\n"
"   Instans akan dicipta dalam rantau yang dipilih. Rantau ini menentukan ciri-ciri penting berikut:\n"
"     * QPU mana yang tersedia.\n"
"     * Di mana pengkomputeran klasik kerja, seperti penyusunan, berlaku.\n"
"     * Di mana data aliran kerja pengguna kekal.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    The workflow data includes the input circuits, circuit parameters, and quantum computation results.  It does not include metadata, such as number of shots, size of circuits, or other job statistics.\n"
msgstr "    Data aliran kerja termasuk litar input, parameter litar, dan keputusan pengkomputeran kuantum. Ia tidak termasuk metadata, seperti bilangan tembakan, saiz litar, atau statistik kerja lain.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   To avoid exposure of the user's workflow data to a global Distributed Denial of Service protection layer, you can use [Virtual Private Endpoints](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/overview?topic=overview-endpoints-support). `qiskit-ibm-runtime` supports this through the [`private_endpoint` parameter](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service).\n"
"   </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"   Untuk mengelakkan pendedahan data aliran kerja pengguna kepada lapisan perlindungan Distributed Denial of Service global, anda boleh menggunakan [Virtual Private Endpoints](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/overview?topic=overview-endpoints-support). `qiskit-ibm-runtime` menyokong ini melalui [parameter `private_endpoint`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service).\n"
"   </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "From the dashboard Instances pane, click **View all**, or go to the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page from the main menu.\n"
msgstr "Dari panel Instances papan pemuka, klik **View all**, atau pergi ke halaman [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) dari menu utama.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "From the Instances page, click **Create instance**.\n"
msgstr "Dari halaman Instances, klik **Create instance**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter a name and optionally add tags.\n"
msgstr "Masukkan nama dan secara pilihan tambah tag.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have access to more than one resource group in IBM Cloud&reg;, you can choose to change the resource group this instance belongs to. See [Managing resource groups](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-rgs&interface=ui) and [Giving access to resources in resource groups](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-rgs_manage_access) for more information.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda mempunyai akses kepada lebih daripada satu kumpulan sumber dalam IBM Cloud&reg;, anda boleh memilih untuk menukar kumpulan sumber yang dimiliki instans ini. Lihat [Mengurus kumpulan sumber](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-rgs&interface=ui) dan [Memberi akses kepada sumber dalam kumpulan sumber](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-rgs_manage_access) untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Select the pricing plan this instance is associated with (for example, Pay-As-You-Go). Depending on the pricing plan selected, you can specify other options, such as the cost limit or the number of minutes to allocate to this instance. Note that if this instance is not associated with a free plan, a cost will be incurred when this instance is used to run workloads.\n"
msgstr "Pilih pelan harga yang berkaitan dengan instans ini (contohnya, Pay-As-You-Go). Bergantung pada pelan harga yang dipilih, anda boleh menentukan pilihan lain, seperti had kos atau bilangan minit yang diperuntukkan untuk instans ini. Perhatikan bahawa jika instans ini tidak berkaitan dengan pelan percuma, kos akan ditanggung apabila instans ini digunakan untuk menjalankan beban kerja.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click **Next**. A list of the QPUs the instance can access is shown.\n"
msgstr "Klik **Next**. Senarai QPU yang boleh diakses oleh instans ditunjukkan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you want the instance to have access to all the QPUs listed (and all QPUs added to this plan in the future), click **Next**.\n"
msgstr "Jika anda ingin instans mempunyai akses kepada semua QPU yang tersenarai (dan semua QPU yang ditambah ke pelan ini pada masa hadapan), klik **Next**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    - If you are not setting up an open instance, you can customize which QPUs can be accessed with this instance. Click the \"Customize allocated compute resources\" toggle. Select specific QPUs that this instance can access, then click **Next**.\n"
"        <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"      If you customize the allocated compute resources, the available QPUs will never be automatically updated, regardless of any changes made to the parent plan.  However, you can manually add or remove QPUs later. If you do not customize them, you will always have access to any QPU to which the account has access on the plan. So if in the future there is a new QPU added to the plan, the instance automatically has access to it.\n"
"        </Admonition>\n"
"1. The Access group pane opens. A \"collaborators\" access group is automatically created for this instance. Users added to this access group can use the time allocated to this instance. You can [modify or create additional access groups](/guides/access-groups) by using the [IBM Cloud console](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/groups). See [Setting up access groups](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=ui) for instructions.\n"
"1. Click **Create instance**. You can now view the instance on the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page. If you have set up multiple plans on your account, each plan type has its own tab on the Instances table.\n"
msgstr ""
"    - Jika anda tidak menyediakan instans terbuka, anda boleh menyesuaikan QPU mana yang boleh diakses dengan instans ini. Klik togol \"Customize allocated compute resources\". Pilih QPU tertentu yang boleh diakses instans ini, kemudian klik **Next**.\n"
"        <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"      Jika anda menyesuaikan sumber pengkomputeran yang diperuntukkan, QPU yang tersedia tidak akan pernah dikemaskini secara automatik, tanpa mengira sebarang perubahan yang dibuat pada pelan induk. Walau bagaimanapun, anda boleh menambah atau membuang QPU secara manual kemudian. Jika anda tidak menyesuaikannya, anda akan sentiasa mempunyai akses kepada mana-mana QPU yang boleh diakses akaun dalam pelan tersebut. Jadi jika pada masa hadapan ada QPU baharu ditambah ke pelan, instans secara automatik mempunyai akses kepadanya.\n"
"        </Admonition>\n"
"1. Panel Kumpulan Akses dibuka. Kumpulan akses \"collaborators\" dicipta secara automatik untuk instans ini. Pengguna yang ditambah ke kumpulan akses ini boleh menggunakan masa yang diperuntukkan kepada instans ini. Anda boleh [mengubah suai atau mencipta kumpulan akses tambahan](/guides/access-groups) menggunakan [konsol IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/groups). Lihat [Menyediakan kumpulan akses](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-groups&interface=ui) untuk arahan.\n"
"1. Klik **Create instance**. Anda kini boleh melihat instans di halaman [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Jika anda telah menyediakan beberapa pelan pada akaun anda, setiap jenis pelan mempunyai tab tersendiri pada jadual Instances.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Pending workloads\">\n"
"The Pending workloads column on the Instances table shows the number of workloads currently queued in this instance across all QPUs.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Pending workloads\">\n"
"Lajur Pending workloads pada jadual Instances menunjukkan bilangan beban kerja yang sedang menunggu dalam giliran dalam instans ini merentas semua QPU.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Edit an instance and its allocation {#edit-an-instance-and-its-allocation}"
msgstr "Edit instans dan peruntukkannya {#edit-an-instance-and-its-allocation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find the instance on the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page. Click the overflow menu at the end the instance's row, and select Edit details.\n"
msgstr "Cari instans di halaman [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Klik menu limpahan di hujung baris instans, dan pilih Edit details.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Only administrators and owners can edit the instance.  See the [Create access policies and access groups](/guides/access-groups) guide for information about assigning access.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Hanya pentadbir dan pemilik yang boleh mengedit instans. Lihat panduan [Cipta polisi akses dan kumpulan akses](/guides/access-groups) untuk maklumat tentang menetapkan akses.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Archived instances {#archived-instances}"
msgstr "Instans yang diarkibkan {#archived-instances}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "An archived instance is the result of one of the following scenarios.\n"
msgstr "Instans yang diarkibkan ialah hasil daripada salah satu senario berikut.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "A privileged user has archived the account {#a-privileged-user-has-archived-the-account}"
msgstr "Pengguna berkeistimewaan telah mengarkibkan akaun {#a-privileged-user-has-archived-the-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A user with sufficient privileges for the account has archived the instance.\n"
"    - Any pending jobs in the instance are canceled.\n"
"    - Archived instances appear in a separate \"Archive\" section on the Instances page.\n"
"    - Jobs can still be retrieved.\n"
"    - Users cannot submit new jobs to the archived instance.\n"
"    - The archived instance does not count against your plan's allocation.\n"
"    - A user with sufficient privileges can reactivate an instance that they (or another privileged user) archived at any time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pengguna dengan keistimewaan yang mencukupi untuk akaun telah mengarkibkan instans tersebut.\n"
"    - Sebarang kerja yang belum dilaksanakan dalam instans dibatalkan.\n"
"    - Instans yang diarkibkan muncul dalam bahagian \"Archive\" yang berasingan di halaman Instances.\n"
"    - Kerja masih boleh diperoleh semula.\n"
"    - Pengguna tidak boleh menghantar kerja baharu ke instans yang diarkibkan.\n"
"    - Instans yang diarkibkan tidak dikira terhadap peruntukan pelan anda.\n"
"    - Pengguna dengan keistimewaan yang mencukupi boleh mengaktifkan semula instans yang mereka (atau pengguna berkeistimewaan lain) arkibkan pada bila-bila masa.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To archive an instance you manage, go to the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page. At the end of the row for that instance, click the three-dot overflow menu on the right, then select *Archive instance*.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengarkibkan instans yang anda urus, pergi ke halaman [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Di hujung baris untuk instans tersebut, klik menu limpahan tiga titik di sebelah kanan, kemudian pilih *Archive instance*.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Account no longer has access to the instance's plan {#account-no-longer-has-access-to-the-instances-plan}"
msgstr "Akaun tidak lagi mempunyai akses kepada pelan instans {#account-no-longer-has-access-to-the-instances-plan}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The account no longer has access to the plan under which the instance was created.\n"
msgstr "Akaun tidak lagi mempunyai akses kepada pelan yang di bawahnya instans dicipta.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Archived instances appear in a separate \"Archive\" section on the Instances page.\n"
msgstr "Instans yang diarkibkan muncul dalam bahagian \"Archive\" yang berasingan di halaman Instances.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Jobs can still be retrieved.\n"
msgstr "Kerja masih boleh diperoleh semula.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users cannot submit new jobs to the archived instance.\n"
msgstr "Pengguna tidak boleh menghantar kerja baharu ke instans yang diarkibkan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The archived instance does not count against your plan's allocation.\n"
msgstr "Instans yang diarkibkan tidak dikira terhadap peruntukan pelan anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instances that have been archived because they no longer have visibility into the instance's plan can't be reactivated.\n"
msgstr "Instans yang telah diarkibkan kerana ia tidak lagi mempunyai keterlihatan ke dalam pelan instans tidak boleh diaktifkan semula.\n"

